Chinese RoBERTa whole-word-masking vocabulary

Source model card: https://huggingface.co/hfl/chinese-roberta-wwm-ext-large
Source project: https://github.com/ymcui/Chinese-BERT-wwm
License declared by source model card: Apache License 2.0.
Complete license: APACHE-LICENSE in this directory.

The source repository is based on https://github.com/google-research/bert.
The APK uses the WordPiece vocabulary through the shared Genie tokenizer.
The large RoBERTa ONNX model is external to the APK.

Resource authors credited by the model card:
Yiming Cui, Wanxiang Che, Ting Liu, Bing Qin, Ziqing Yang, Shijin Wang,
Guoping Hu.

Primary resource publication:
Cui et al. (2020), Revisiting Pre-Trained Models for Chinese Natural Language
Processing, Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP
2020, pages 657--668. https://aclanthology.org/2020.findings-emnlp.58/

Secondary resource publication:
Pre-Training with Whole Word Masking for Chinese BERT.
https://arxiv.org/abs/1906.08101
